[?2004l[?2004h> cursor = conn.cursor()
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> # Let's find process GUIDs for:
[?2004l[?2004h> # 1. GruntHTTP.exe
[?2004l[?2004h> # 2. cmd.exe (under GruntHTTP.exe)
